The Chain File for liftOver converting TCGA Data from hg38 to hg19 is in the file "hg38ToHg19.over.chain"

Data from the original paper (Maximo et al., 2024), is in the file "Paper_TC_Data.txt"

TCGA data is "TCGA-THCA.maf.gz", while the TCGA clinical data is in "TCGA_Clinical.txt"

GENIE data is located in "GENIE_Mutation_Data.txt", while the GENIE clinical data is in "GENIE_Clinical.txt"
